  "Compute detention with configurable detention policies — clock rules, tiered rates, notices, and full calculation receipts — instead of the legacy flat threshold below. Requires at least one Active detention policy or a default policy.": "以可配置的滞留费制度计算滞留费 — 包含计时规则、阶梯费率、通知与完整计算明细 — 取代下方的旧版固定阈值。须至少有一项启用中的滞留费制度或默认制度。",
  "Configure and manage your shipment control settings": "配置并管理运单控制项",
  "Configure how the system automatically voids shipments that have been in the \"New\" status for more than the configured threshold based on the creation date. This helps maintain operational efficiency and ensures that shipments are not left in a \"New\" state for an extended period of time.": "配置系统如何依创建日期，自动作废停留在“新增”状态超过设定阈值的运单。此举有助于维持运营效率，并避免运单长时间停留在“新增”状态。",
  "Configure how the system identifies, records, and responds to shipment delays throughout the transportation lifecycle. Automated delay detection and status updates improve operational visibility, enable proactive customer communication, and provide key data for service failure analysis. These settings determine when a shipment's status is automatically changed to \"Delayed\" and what threshold triggers escalation protocols.": "配置系统在整个运输周期中如何识别、记录并响应运单延误。自动延误检测与状态更新可提升运营可见度、促成主动联系客户，并为服务失误分析提供关键数据。这些设置决定运单状态何时自动变更为“延误”，以及何种阈值会触发升级处理流程。",
  "Configure how the system monitors, calculates, and bills for detention time when drivers are delayed at shipping or receiving facilities beyond allowable timeframes. Proper detention tracking helps recover revenue, improve asset utilization, and provide documentation for customer negotiations.": "配置系统在司机于发货或收货场站滞留超过允许时间时，如何监控、计算并计费滞留时间。妥善跟踪滞留有助于回收收入、提升资产利用效率，并为客户谈判提供佐证材料。",
  "Default detention policy": "默认滞留费制度",
  "Define core operational rules for shipment creation, validation, and management throughout the shipment lifecycle. These settings establish system-wide behaviors that ensure data integrity, prevent duplications, and determine permissible operations for users across all departments.": "定义运单创建、校验与管理在整个生命周期中的核心作业规则。这些设置建立全系统行为，确保数据完整性、避免重复，并决定各部门用户可执行的操作。",
  "Defines the number of days a shipment can be in the 'New' status before it is automatically canceled.": "定义运单在自动取消前可停留于“新增”状态的天数。",
