  "Establish key performance indicators (KPIs) and operational targets that drive your transportation business. These metrics serve as benchmarks for evaluating carrier performance, influence performance-based compensation models, and help identify operational improvement opportunities. The targets set here will be used across dashboards, reports, and exception alerts.": "建立推动运输业务的关键绩效指标（KPI）与运营目标。这些指标可作为评估承运商绩效的基准、影响绩效薪酬模式，并协助发现运营改进机会。此处设置的目标将用于仪表板、报表与例外提醒。",
