  "Sets the upper weight limit (in pounds) for shipments created in the system. This helps ensure compliance with carrier weight restrictions and prevents data entry errors during shipment creation.": "设置系统中所创建运单的重量上限 (磅)。有助于符合承运商的重量限制，并避免创建运单时的数据录入错误。",
